<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelans bang pots, protest cost of living.</title>
<headline>Venezuelans bang pots, protest cost of living.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelans briefly protested early Thursday night in the capital's poorer districts lighting fireworks and banging pots and pans over the rising cost of living.</p>
<p>No one was hurt during the 15-minute demonstration. Hooded youths burnt tires in the 23rd of January district, but most protesters stayed at home as police forces were deployed.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
